Third-party software
====================
proto/third_party/otlp/ holds the OpenTelemetry protocol message definitions
(opentelemetry-proto, Copyright The OpenTelemetry Authors), vendored
unchanged under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see the LICENSE and SOURCE
files there); internal/gen/opentelemetry/ is the Go code generated from them.

Third-party dependencies are listed in go.mod/go.sum and the SDK lockfiles,
and in the SBOM attached to every official release. Their licenses are
reproduced in release artifacts as required.

